297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"试验干预：KZ-sGC901片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"7a58d261936be87dc0a83127458f50422e93df3bcea24e68ee5bff6dc32646bb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_003","es_004","es_005","es_006","es_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KZ-sGC901非临床药效学数据及sGC-cGMP通路在HFrEF中的机制文献","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_01","missing_source_classes":["非临床药效学报告","机制文献"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础 - 分子机制段落"},{"action":"补充KZ-sGC901非临床PK/PD数据以支持2.5/5/10 mg剂量梯度的药理学依据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_02","missing_source_classes":["非临床药代动力学报告"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础 - 剂量选择依据段落"},{"action":"补充NT-proBNP作为HFrEF替代终点的文献验证或既往研究支持","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_24_03","missing_source_classes":["生物标志物验证文献"],"target":"2.4 本研究的理论基础 - 终点选择依据段落"}],"heading":"本研究的理论基础","missing_source_classes":["KZ-sGC901非临床药效学数据（sGC激活、cGMP升高、血管舒张、抗纤维化）","KZ-sGC901非临床药代动力学数据","sGC-cGMP通路在HFrEF病理生理中的机制文献","NT-proBNP作为HFrEF替代终点的验证文献"],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，其理论基础建立在以下已确认的研究设计逻辑之上。第一，KZ-sGC901为口服可溶性鸟苷酸环化酶（sGC）刺激剂，通过激活sGC-cGMP信号通路发挥血管舒张和抗纤维化作用，本研究旨在验证该机制在射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）人群中的初步疗效信号。第二，研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，设置KZ-sGC901低剂量（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量（5 mg每日一次）和高剂量（10 mg每日一次）三个试验组及安慰剂对照组，按1:1:1:1比例随机分配，治疗期12周，所有受试者联合标准指南指导的药物治疗（GDMT）背景。第三，剂量选择依据为：低剂量用于初步验证sGC刺激机制在HFrEF中的生物学效应，中剂量和高剂量用于探索剂量-反应关系，为后续III期确证性研究的剂量选择提供依据。第四，主要疗效评价采用第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，该生物标志物反映心室壁张力和神经内分泌激活程度，与HFrEF疾病严重程度及预后相关，在双盲期内于基线、第4周、第8周和第12周进行采集。第五，目标人群为18至75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF成人，左室射血分数不超过40%，纽约心功能分级II至III级，筛选前已接受稳定剂量GDMT至少4周仍有心衰症状，旨在排除急性失代偿期干扰并聚焦于慢性稳定期残余症状的改善。第六，安全性评估涵盖不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征（血压、心率）、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标、12导联心电图，每4周随访评估耐受性。","rationale":"本章节正文基于项目已确认的研究设计事实撰写：内在研究目的（概念验证与剂量探索）、总体设计（随机双盲安慰剂对照平行组多中心）、三剂量方案（2.5/5/10 mg qd）、主要终点（NT-proBNP百分比变化）、目标人群特征、安全性评估范围。sGC-cGMP通路的分子机制描述为基于药物类别（sGC刺激剂）的一般性机制说明，非来自本项目专属非临床数据。医学经理需核实：（1）sGC-cGMP通路在HFrEF中的机制描述是否需引用具体文献或IB数据；（2）NT-proBNP作为替代终点的选择依据是否需补充文献支持；（3）剂量梯度设计的药理学依据是否需补充非临床PK/PD数据。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_47de925313a6a3c8","section_number":"2.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007065229_4ef37d4d","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"161db75499e2f57b4c26d1e22eabe8a3ca40273b7dc79a8bf7277c712e931de9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"安全性终点：不良事件与严重不良事件发生率；症状性低血压与体位性低血压；生命体征（血压、心率）；肝肾功能、电解质实验室指标；12导联心电图","quote_sha256":"e77501ca084e2f1e9fa18684d494f2252570a19a158da14e097274f13b01fb6b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_f080ca4260c090f9:full-draft:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","span_id":"es_008"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_002","es_005","es_006","es_007","es_008"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认是否设置次要目的和次要终点，若设置则提供具体清单及评价时点","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_3_01","missing_source_classes":["研究目的与终点定义文件"],"target":"3 研究目的和终点 - 次要目的与次要终点"},{"action":"确认本研究是否设置探索性目的或探索性终点；若不设置则明确声明本研究不设置探索性目的和终点","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_3_02","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"3 研究目的和终点 - 探索性目的与终点"}],"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":["次要目的和次要终点清单","探索性目的和探索性终点（如适用）","各安全性终点的详细采集时点与判定标准"],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，旨在评估口服sGC刺激剂KZ-sGC901在慢性稳定性射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）成人中的初步疗效信号、剂量-反应关系及安全性特征。主要目的为验证KZ-sGC901对HFrEF患者心室壁张力相关生物标志物的影响，并探索不同剂量水平间的疗效差异，为后续确证性研究提供剂量选择依据。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，评价时间点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周，在双盲期内完成。安全性终点包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征（血压、心率）、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标、12导联心电图。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点采用协方差分析（ANCOVA，基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性数据采用描述统计，次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。","rationale":"本章节正文基于项目已确认的研究目的（概念验证与剂量探索）、主要终点（第12周NT-proBNP百分比变化及评价时间点）、安全性终点范围、统计分析策略（FAS、ANCOVA、剂量-反应趋势检验、层级分析）撰写。医学经理需核实：（1）是否需在本章节中列出次要目的和次要终点（当前已确认事实中未明确列出具体次要终点清单）；（2）是否需设置探索性目的或探索性终点；（3）安全性终点中各项目的具体采集时点和判定标准是否需在本章节或后续章节中进一步细化。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究目的和终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_a1b7d1f0ceb3dd2d","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007065229_4ef37d4d","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"161db75499e2f57b4c26d1e22eabe8a3ca40273b7dc79a8bf7277c712e931de9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"统计分析策略：FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"9cf37f0df8f4d6bd00beb8c92cebe88f07431911c16227896760d446ca13e075","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_f080ca4260c090f9:full-draft:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","quote":"试验干预：KZ-sGC901片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"7a58d261936be87dc0a83127458f50422e93df3bcea24e68ee5bff6dc32646bb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","span_id":"es_009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_005","es_007","es_008","es_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认NT-proBNP百分比变化是否具有临床意义的预设阈值及依据","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_31_01","missing_source_classes":["生物标志物临床意义文献","既往研究效应量数据"],"target":"3.1 主要目的和主要终点 - 临床意义阈值"},{"action":"确认ANCOVA协变量选择、剂量-反应趋势检验方法及多重比较校正策略","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_31_02","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划（SAP）"],"target":"3.1 主要目的和主要终点 - 统计分析细节"}],"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":["NT-proBNP临床意义阈值定义","ANCOVA协变量选择依据","剂量-反应趋势检验具体方法","多重比较校正策略"],"proposal_text":"本研究的主要目的为评估KZ-sGC901在慢性稳定性HFrEF成人中对心室壁张力相关生物标志物的影响，并探索剂量-反应关系。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，在双盲期内评价。NT-proBNP的采集与评价时间点为基线（随机入组前）、第4周、第8周和第12周。主要分析采用全分析集（FAS），以ANCOVA方法（以基线NT-proBNP为协变量）比较各剂量组与安慰剂组第12周NT-proBNP百分比变化的组间差异，同时检验剂量-反应趋势。","rationale":"本章节正文基于项目已确认的主要终点定义（第12周NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化、双盲期）、评价时间点（基线、第4/8/12周）、主要分析集（FAS）和统计方法（ANCOVA基线校正、剂量-反应趋势检验）撰写。医学经理需核实：（1）NT-proBNP百分比变化是否具有临床意义的预设阈值（如较基线下降一定比例视为有临床意义）；（2）ANCOVA中除基线NT-proBNP外是否需纳入其他协变量；（3）剂量-反应趋势检验的具体统计方法（如线性趋势检验、Dunnett检验等）；（4）主要终点分析中是否需预设多重比较校正策略。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（主要目的和主要终点）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_586cd742908d5bd8","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a1616fe22868fa","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"0000110ccbe4f10e009fe99ceefe5207b0b8584ef31f4d06e9a463b6b1647fb5","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_1d9c980ff646_f080ca4260c090f9:full-draft:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:48f9bb5ed470998b1b400d0a6898b5aa75c50eb16e9382572ea3957a2dfba2b9:f367ffb8503a95743d75743b","text_sha256":"0000110ccbe4f10e009fe99ceefe5207b0b8584ef31f4d06e9a463b6b1647fb5"},{"content_sha256":"531e9b4314487bef6799cf6fccefaf3196eedd19a833eb5813d4066e11ab57fa","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_4dc5f9917297f5bf1193:r6:07f7cfe7ab9105fb","text_sha256":"531e9b4314487bef6799cf6fccefaf3196eedd19a833eb5813d4066e11ab57fa"},{"content_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_versio